Package: com.stevenjc.ios6revival.logwatch
Name: Phone Log
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Logs only warnings, errors and crashes. Once an hour checks the log size; at the limit in Settings shows a banner, then deletes the log after the set number of days.
Maintainer: steve
Author: steve
Section: Tweaks
Depends: com.stevenjc.ios6revival.notify, preferenceloader
